{"unit_id":"ToBeWin__DSH-Temporary-Chat#card-zh","repo":"ToBeWin/DSH-Temporary-Chat","commit":"63b84892215975cafb3ffeb15a616c0878f04fea","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Temporary Chat 是面向 Web 客户端的临时对话插件，可在不打开工作区时开始新的 DSH 会话。它通过 Web Host 的公开扩展槽在侧栏加入入口，并在首条消息前显示独立输入框。用户可以选择 Host 已配置的 Agent 预设、模型、推理强度和权限模式；发送首条消息后交由 Harness 原生会话界面继续处理。适合希望先提问、之后再决定是否使用项目工作区的 DSH 用户。安装后需要兼容版本为 0.0.1 的 Web Host；不需要额外插件密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:633-678","client/client.js:562-631","client/client.js:143-147"]}
{"unit_id":"ToBeWin__DSH-Temporary-Chat#card-en","repo":"ToBeWin/DSH-Temporary-Chat","commit":"63b84892215975cafb3ffeb15a616c0878f04fea","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Temporary Chat starts a native Web session without a workspace. Its sidebar action opens a first-message composer with Host-provided Agent, model, reasoning, and permission choices; Harness takes over after sending. Requires Web Host 0.0.1; no plugin-specific key or external service.","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:633-678","client/client.js:562-631","client/client.js:143-147"]}
