{"unit_id":"ToBeWin__DSH-Temporary-Chat#feature-1","repo":"ToBeWin/DSH-Temporary-Chat","commit":"63b84892215975cafb3ffeb15a616c0878f04fea","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Temporary Chat 的功能「侧栏新建临时会话」：点击侧栏入口会创建原生 DSH Session，等待 Host 发布该会话后立即打开。会话不关联工作区。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:639-655","client/client.js:174-197"]}
{"unit_id":"ToBeWin__DSH-Temporary-Chat#feature-2","repo":"ToBeWin/DSH-Temporary-Chat","commit":"63b84892215975cafb3ffeb15a616c0878f04fea","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Temporary Chat 的功能「首条消息输入」：新会话为空时显示临时输入框，用户输入并提交首条消息后，后续交回 Harness 原生会话界面。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:562-631","client/client.js:656-678"]}
{"unit_id":"ToBeWin__DSH-Temporary-Chat#feature-3","repo":"ToBeWin/DSH-Temporary-Chat","commit":"63b84892215975cafb3ffeb15a616c0878f04fea","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Temporary Chat 的功能「首条消息前选择模型」：临时输入框读取当前会话可用模型和推理强度，用户选择后通过 Host 会话 API 更新会话选项。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:426-519"]}
{"unit_id":"ToBeWin__DSH-Temporary-Chat#feature-4","repo":"ToBeWin/DSH-Temporary-Chat","commit":"63b84892215975cafb3ffeb15a616c0878f04fea","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Temporary Chat 的功能「Agent 与权限预设」：输入框允许选择 Host 提供的 Agent 预设，并通过会话命令切换可用权限模式；选项来自当前 Host。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:343-423","client/client.js:522-560"]}
{"unit_id":"ToBeWin__DSH-Temporary-Chat#caveat-1","repo":"ToBeWin/DSH-Temporary-Chat","commit":"63b84892215975cafb3ffeb15a616c0878f04fea","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Temporary Chat 使用浏览器 localStorage 保存最近最多 100 个临时会话 ID，以便识别临时会话；浏览器阻止存储时仍会尝试创建会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:149-172"]}
